  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  characterName: "Aim\xE9e Lumumba (CEO)"
  promptText: Our batteries use cobalt from mines where children work and families
    suffer, and our shareholders demand record profits this year. Do I keep selling
    these devices and profit from that harm, or halt production and risk bankrupting
    the company?
  leftAnswer: Yes, continue production; the jobs it supports steady many families
    today.
  rightAnswer: No, stop the supply chain; end the harm, even if you risk losing everything.
